<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello </span>{!Contact.FirstName}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">We have been attempting to reach you regarding payment on your account. A legal demand has been issued as of&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Legal_Demand_Sent__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">. There is still time to bring your account out of delinquency. If you are unable to maintain full payments currently, we have temporary modification to help. Please reach out immediately by replying to this email or by phone via my direct line at the bottom of this email.</span></div><div style=""><div style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you,&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.OwnerFullName}<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;">&nbsp;|&nbsp;</font>{!Case.OwnerTitle}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of</span></b><br style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</b></span></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}&nbsp;| F:&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;">E:&nbsp;</span>{!Case.OwnerEmail}</font></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
